{"hymn":"SY82","parent":"NS762","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":1,"merge":0},"title":"Dejó Él Su gloria","subtitle":"","syl":{"n2":["De","i"],"n3":["jó","t"],"n4":"Él","n5":"Su","n6":["glo","i"],"n7":["ria,","t"],"n9":"Fue","n10":["man","i"],"n11":["so","t"],"n12":["y‿hu","i"],"n13":["mil","m"],"n14":["de.","t"],"n17":["Se‿hi","i"],"n18":["zo","t"],"n19":["cria","i"],"n20":["tu","m"],"n21":["ra","t"],"n22":"quien","n24":"La","n25":["vi","i"],"n26":["da","t"],"n27":["cre","i"],"n28":["ó.","t"],"n30":["Su","i"],"n31":["frió‿el","t"],"n32":["a","i"],"n33":["ban","m"],"n34":["do","m"],"n35":["no,","t"],"n37":["Do","i"],"n38":["lor,","t"],"n39":["pe","i"],"n40":["na‿y","t"],"n41":["bur","i"],"n42":["la,","t"],"n45":"De","n46":["glo","i"],"n47":["ria‿in","m"],"n48":["fi","m"],"n49":["ni","m"],"n50":["ta,","t"],"n52":"A","n53":["su","i"],"n54":["frir","t"],"n55":["des","i"],"n56":["dén.","t","u"],"n57":0},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Llegó a ser humilde,","Y a estar limitado,","Se hizo finito y es","Un hombre en verdad.","¡En Cristo el plan de Dios","Se hizo tangible!","Dos naturalezas:","El Dios-hombre es Él."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Liberó Su gloria","Nos impartió vida,","Y los muchos granos","Él Logró producir.","Se goza el primero con","Sus muchos hermanos.","Lo humano y divino en Él","Se incorporaron."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Por tanto hay que amarle.","¡Pionero precioso!","Son nuestra victoria hoy","Su pena y dolor.","A hijos de juicio,","Hoy lleva a la gloria.","Dios-hombres en miles,","Se gozan con Él."]}]}